      "issues": [
        "- In the plural rules table (section 2), rule 2 incorrectly states \"आकारांत स्त्रीलिंग → एँ\" with example \"लड़की\"; \"लड़की\" is ईकारांत, not आकारांत. → Rule should be \"ईकारांत स्त्रीलिंग → एँ\" or \"आ/ईकारांत स्त्रीलिंग → एँ\".",
        "- In the mind map (section 7), node C2b repeats the same error: \"आकारांत स्त्रीलिंग → एँ\". → Change to \"ईकारांत स्त्रीलिंग → एँ\".",
        "- In flashcard 3 (section 8), the explanation for \"लड़की\" plural says \"(आकारांत स्त्रीलिंग → एँ)\"; \"लड़की\" is ईकारांत. → Change to \"(ईकारांत स्त्रीलिंग → एँ)\".",
        "- In the mind map (section 7), node B3 lists \"गुरु\" as an exception (अपवाद) for gender; \"गुरु\" is a regular masculine noun (उकारांत nouns are predominantly masculine), not an exception. → Remove \"गुरु\" from exceptions or clarify that उकारांत nouns are usually masculine.",
        "- In flashcard 17 (section 8), the answer for \"गुरु\" gender says \"(उकारांत पुल्लिंग अपवाद)\"; this misstates that masculine उकारांत is exceptional. → Change to \"(उकारांत पुल्लिंग, सामान्य नियम)\"."
      ],
